      },
      {
        "id": "retained blink",
        "verdict": "PROVISIONALLY_USEFUL_REUSE",
        "reason": "Eye closure remains readable during actual75\u201377/100ms, without a distracting palette-induced eye artifact. Exact neutral return78 retained."
      },
      {
        "id": "neutral and feather/foot identity",
        "verdict": "PROVISIONALLY_USEFUL",
        "reason": "Recognizable charcoal/gray feather layers, head, eye and toes remain legible. Some subtle feather shades flatten, but normal-size identity/detail loss is not distracting."
      }
    ],
    "normalSizeFinding": "Actual186CSS raw-vs32palette on light/dark, density1, unchanged common crop/origin/pivot and fractional source-world extent. Own live look60/18/12 ends89through3000ms; retained blink75/3/42 ends119through4000ms. No page errors. The RGB-only branch does not manufacture geometry or movement; mild contour/toe shimmer already present in source remains.",
    "qualifications": "Only source appearance is passed. Original63color branch and its actual rectangle-budget failure remain unchanged evidence. Actual fixed32palette normalization/proposal validation is a separate coordinator gate; no further palette trials are authorized or performed by this reviewer. Source drawings/masks/geometry/clocks are not credited as new output. Contacts, pressure/support, private runtime pins and live admission remain unapproved; runtime NOT_TESTED."
  },
